                      "Tissue injury or inappropriate clamping"
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Viva tip: If the examiner shows a simple, slender, blunt instrument with no jaws, consider a sinus probe rather than sinus forceps."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
